<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cold Resistance</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 7), Conjurer (guild level 16)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cold resistance &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cold resistance</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Raises the target's frost sphere for about ten minutes. Your ability in a 
sphere also protects you against its spells (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>), so the 
target resists frost spells better: snowball, frostball, iceball, blizzard, 
frost breath and the like. The better your protection sphere, the bigger the 
raise, up to ten points and a little more for a master.
</p><p>It doesn't add up: cast on someone who already has it, the magic just 
dissipates. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on potions, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Frost Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Heat Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>